== Welcome
Hi, welcome to my website! I am currently a Postdoctoral Research Scientist at Amazon Robotics. I obtained my Ph.D. at the Autonomous and Intelligent Robotics (AIR) Laboratory, Department of Mechanical Engineering, [https://www1.lehigh.edu/ Lehigh University], working under the advisory of Prof. Nader Motee. 

My research interests are in *risk and robustness analysis in networked control systems and perception systems*.